<EnglishInfoPage title="Cookie Policy | QCT Commerce" description="Cookie policy explaining essential functionality, consent preferences and optional analytics on qctcommerce.com." eyebrow="LEGAL" heading="Cookie policy" lead="Essential site functions and optional analytics are handled separately. Optional analytics follows the user's consent choice." sections={[{title:'Essential functions',text:'Technical storage may be used where required for core site operation and preference handling.'},{title:'Optional analytics',text:'GA4 Consent Mode keeps analytics storage disabled until consent and may send limited cookieless signals. Google Tag Manager and Microsoft Clarity load after consent. Clarity produces masked session recordings and heatmaps. You can change your preference using the Cookie preferences button.'},{title:'Preference controls',text:'Where available, the site’s cookie controls can be used to manage optional analytics preferences.'},{title:'Questions',text:'Questions about cookies or privacy can be sent to info@qctcommerce.com.'}]}/>